SeedVR2 RMSNorm backport for the existing H3 experiment image

This derivative modifies vllm_omni/diffusion/models/seedvr2/nadit.py from
vLLM-Omni 0.31.0rc1 by backporting PR #8767, commit
0708f05e2e27f16fca8b48e7c5a085277d1cafda. Copyright contributors to the
vLLM-Omni project. The upstream Apache-2.0 license is in upstream/LICENSE.

The change computes low-precision RMSNorm intermediates in FP32 and restores
the input dtype before the optional affine multiplication. It does not change
the checkpoint weights, framework package versions, normalization epsilon,
schedule, attention implementation, VAE or parallelism.

The original wheel origin receipt remains valid as installation provenance;
it is not a statement that the installed wheel is unmodified. The separate
patch-application report records the exact source and RECORD modification.

Inherited /legal notices and SBOM describe the parent dependencies and remain
unchanged. No new third-party package is installed. This file documents the
source modification, not a new legal clearance or GPU-quality acceptance.
